msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today, we released 1.2.1.Final which is a small iteration on top of 1.2.0."
"Final with only bugfixes and documentation fixes."
msgstr ""

msgid "This is a safe upgrade for everyone using 1.2.0.Final."
msgstr ""

msgid "Bugfixes and documentation improvements"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The most important issue we fixed is the regression in the MariaDB driver "
"when building native executables."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"But we fixed other issues and some inaccuracies in the documentation.\n"
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/1.2.1."
"Final[the full changelog of 1.2.1.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
